#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Lots of buying? Can buy friends seeds?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
