#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.2"
