#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.2"
