#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.2"
