#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.2"
