#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.2"
