#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.2"
