#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.2"
